# Senior CI/CD

- QA crash-first: lint → seguranca → testes → validate → build; `[skip-cd]` so pula deploy/infra
- OIDC `id-token: write`; sem client secret de longa duracao
- Cache por hash de lock/requirements; jobs por area em paralelo, stages em sequencia
- Imagens por SHA curto; nao promover `latest` a prod
- Gates: Ruff → Bandit/pip-audit → pytest cov-branch 100% → mypy → compileall; Hadolint/Trivy; tflint/tfsec; kubeconform; actionlint
- Doc: `docs/engineering-senior-bar.md`; skill: `mcs-senior-cloud-ops` + `mcs-precommit`
